The Kaathe are a mysterious race of beings of unknown origin. [[Org/Althane/The Weft|The Weft]] have encountered two of them so far, [[People/Althane/Halidex Op-B|Hali]] and [[People/Althane/Tennobrin Er-K|Tenno]]. Their true bodies reside in a dream adjacent to Althane, but they can be communicated with by the orbs they use for locomotion.
